OL,3,AJudge finds Thomas Markle mentally fit
OL,4,Ato stand trial on child abuse charges
OL,5,
OL,6,FA judge in Florida has declared Thomas
OL,7,FMarkle Sr, the father of Meghan,
OL,8,FDuchess of Sussex, to be mentally
OL,9,Fcompetent to stand trial for possessing
OL,10,Findecent images of children.
OL,12,FThe hearing came after an evaluation by
OL,13,Fa court-appointed psychiatrist
OL,14,Fconducted on Prince Harry's 82-year-old
OL,15,Ffather-in-law.
OL,17,FMarkle, who has denied possessing
OL,18,Fimages of child sex abuse, was ordered
OL,19,Fto stay in jail pending trial earlier
OL,20,Fthis month after allegedly removing a
OL,21,Flocation monitoring device.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
