OL,3,AJudge finds Thomas Markle mentally fit
OL,4,Ato stand trial on child abuse charges
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe FBI arrested Markle on 6 November
OL,7,Fat an elderly care home that
OL,8,Fspecialises in dementia. His arrest
OL,9,Fcame after a search of a storage unit
OL,10,Fhe had allegedly rented in Los Angeles
OL,11,Funcovered the abuse material.
